---
title: "borrow_flash_loan (Current Finance: Flash Loan)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: ensure_version_matches + validate_market
    q_validate --> q_check_permission: ensure_has_permission(cap, flash_loan)
    q_check_permission --> q_check_circuit: assert !circuit_break_triggered
    q_check_circuit --> q_check_pause: assert !flash_loan_paused
    q_check_pause --> q_check_ongoing: assert !flash_loan_ongoing
    q_check_ongoing --> q_trigger: asset.flash_loan_triggered()
    q_trigger --> q_get_fee_rate: fee_rate = emode.flash_loan.fee_rate
    q_get_fee_rate --> q_calc_fee: fee = fee_rate.int_mul(amount)
    q_calc_fee --> q_check_fee: assert fee != 0
    q_check_fee --> q_reserve_borrow: reserve.borrow_flash_loan(amount)
    q_reserve_borrow --> q_check_cash: assert amount lt reserve.cash
    q_check_cash --> q_create_potato: FlashLoan hot potato = (inner, fee)
    q_create_potato --> q_emit: emit BorrowFlashLoanEvent
    q_emit --> q_return: return (Coin, FlashLoan)
    q_return --> [*]

    note right of q_create_potato
        INV-001: FlashLoan is a hot potato (no drop/store), must be consumed in same tx
        INV-002: fee is calculated from emode-specific flash_loan_fee_rate
        INV-003: flash_loan_ongoing flag prevents re-entrancy within same asset
        INV-004: flash loan can borrow up to reserve.cash (including cash_reserve)
        INV-005: PackageCallerCap required (whitelisted callers only)
    end note
